{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/36dba23bce2917578c864150ce6c5c75.poster.avif?t=1756749046\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/36dba23bce2917578c864150ce6c5c75.webm?t=1756749046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/36dba23bce2917578c864150ce6c5c75.mp4?t=1756749046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short adventure game that you can play in a few sittings. It's atmospheric and a little bit funny. You are a blob of oil and you have to escape from the oil industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splat off the walls, bowl thru stacks of barrels, and skate across puddles as an elastic blob with Mario-like moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a forklift to lift and stack heavy obstacles to suit your oily needs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and launch oil droplets to grow into a formidable glob or shrink to a modest slick.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try on different hats for a variety of short-term power-ups. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow time to pull a tricky maneuver, or just to savor your character\u2019s outlandish acrobatics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OST by Body Meat.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1653020?t=1756749046","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/81dadc843765da74e58740b60bc18991f88620cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756749046","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/5f8414a63